{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1467583-question-about-fasads","id":1467583,"title":"question about Fasads","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mummy: The Curse"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-11-12T11:53:39-08:00","id":1467583,"title":"question about Fasads","content":"I was just reading through Mummy 2e, and I had some questions about Fasads and how they interact with Bane Affinities.<br /> <br /> A) Can Fasads store Sekhem or gain pillar points by devouring them with Jaws of the Devourer?<br /> <br /> B) If they can't store Sekhem, can they use Schism of Flesh or Sekhem Clot? I assume they can't use body snatcher.<br /> <br /> C) Can invested Fasads who are also sorcerers benefit from the ashen sorcerer investment, and use their Shuankhsen's Bane Rites?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3096-lhangdon_rhyme","name":"Lhangdon_Rhyme","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T11:43:54-08:00","id":1467896,"title":"","content":"The RAW is a little unclear, but my interpretation of those sections would be\u2026<br /> <br /> A) since Fasads don\u2019t have those traits, I would rule that they can\u2019t gain them even with Jaws of the Devourer; that the Sekhem and Pillars would just be lost to Ammit. I also think it\u2019s better for the Story if the Shuankhsen master has to come expose themself to gain the potent benefits of soul consumption.<br /> But I *would* say a sorcerous Fasad could use Jaws of the Devourer to channel Sekhem / Pillars into a vessel, as if consuming a relic.<br /> <br /> B) the rules for Sadikh say that their Arisen master spends the pillars / willpower for any Affinities; I would extend this to Fadad, allowing their shuankhsen to pay the Sekhem costs.<br /> I would probably allow Body Snatcher, as well; I\u2019m not seeing a good reason why not. I\u2019d probably require a Fasad to spend its own invested pillar points, though, rather than letting their master pay the cost. <br /> <br /> C) Yes; I\u2019m most confident that is totally possible.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Second Chance for<br /> <img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=709\" data-tempid=\"temp_709_1572548741915_354\" /><br /> A Beautiful Madness</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/425-seraph-kitty","name":"Seraph Kitty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar425_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}